  "href": "zerosum/zerosum_zero_sum_game.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Zero-Sum Game</h1>\n<p>A zero-sum game in strategic form is a triple $(I,J,g)$ where $I$ is the\nnonempty strategy set of the maximizing player, $J$ is the nonempty strategy\nset of the minimizing player, and $g : I \\times J \\to \\mathbb{R}$ is the\npayoff of the maximizing player.  If the chosen strategies are $(i,j)$, then\nthe maximizing player receives $g(i,j)$ and the minimizing player receives\n$-g(i,j)$.</p>",
